| [Exp 2: DB Saturation](INCIDENT_SIMULATION_GUIDE.md#-experiment-2-database-saturation-high-latency) | DB table lock | HighLatencyP95, HighErrorRate, LatencyFastBurn | RB-22, RB-21, RB-12 |
